<title>USA: IPO PRICING - HomeCom prices at $6.</title>
<headline>IPO PRICING - HomeCom prices at $6.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Company Name	HomeCom Communications Inc</p>
<p>   Priced At					  $6</p>
<p>   Estimated Pricing Range	    $6 - $6.50</p>
<p>   Number of Shares			1,000,000</p>
<p>Lead Underwriter Ladenburg Thalmann &amp; Co Inc</p>
<p>NOTE: The proposed number of shares, estimated price range and ticker symbol for the planned initial public offering in HomeCom Communications Inc were altered.</p>
<p>The proposed number of shares were reduced to one million shares from 1.25 million shares. The estimated price range was lowered to $6 to $6.50 from $6 to $7 at its original filing. The symbol was changed to &quot;HCOM&quot; on Nasdaq from &quot;HMCM.&quot;</p>
</text>
